{"pin":"AB09139","subcodes":[{"code":"AB09139","anchor":"","first_line":"O my God! O my God! This, Thy servant, hath advanced towards Thee, is passionately wandering in the desert of Thy love","first_line_orig":"الهی الهی هذا عبدک الذی اقبل الیک و هام فی هیماء محبتک و سلک فی منهج عبودیتک  ","language":"Ara","word_count":"80","full_text_parts":["O my God! O my God! This, Thy servant, hath advanced towards Thee, is passionately wandering in the desert of Thy love, walking in the path of Thy service, anticipating Thy favors, hoping for Thy bounty, relying upon Thy kingdom, and intoxicated by the wine of Thy gift. O my God! Increase the fervor of his affection for Thee, the constancy of his praise of Thee, and the ardor of his love for Thee.\n\nVerily, Thou art the Most Generous, the Lord of grace abounding. There is no other God but Thee, the Forgiving, the Merciful."],"translations":[{"language":"pt","lang_name":"Portuguese"},{"language":"ca","lang_name":"Catalan"},{"language":"ar","lang_name":"Arabic"},{"language":"lv","lang_name":"Latvian"},{"language":"fr","lang_name":"French"},{"language":"no","lang_name":"Norwegian"},{"language":"fi","lang_name":"Finnish"},{"language":"is","lang_name":"Icelandic"},{"language":"tvl","lang_name":"Tuvalu"},{"language":"ro","lang_name":"Romanian"},{"language":"pl","lang_name":"Polish"},{"language":"nl","lang_name":"Dutch"},{"language":"es","lang_name":"Spanish"},{"language":"en","lang_name":"English"},{"language":"tl","lang_name":"Tagalog"},{"language":"gil","lang_name":"Gilbertese"},{"language":"ht","lang_name":"Haitian Creole"},{"language":"da","lang_name":"Danish"},{"language":"it","lang_name":"Italian"},{"language":"de","lang_name":"German"},{"language":"orig","lang_name":"Original"},{"language":"af","lang_name":"Afrikaans"},{"language":"tr","lang_name":"Turkish"},{"language":"kl","lang_name":"Kalaallisut"},{"language":"az","lang_name":"Azerbaijani"},{"language":"el","lang_name":"Greek"},{"language":"mt","lang_name":"Maltese"},{"